sentences.text:
The act was enacted with four fold objectives :
(i) ensuring safety, efficacy and quality of drugs and cosmetics sold in India;
9 32.J.cri.wp.967.2024.odt (ii) preventing sub-standard products (adulterated and mis- branded drugs or cosmetics) from reaching consumers;
(iii) establishing legal standards and guidelines for the manufacture, import, sale and distribution of drugs and cosmetics;
(iv) Protecting public health by ensuring that harmful or ineffective substances do not enter the market;
Due to the conduct of the concerned officers, the objectives with which the Act was enacted is getting frustrated.
